@title 3D Heat panel: Cooler layout takes you to the Cabinet view with the search
@area Heat
# The button sits in the 3D Heat panel too. It used to do nothing there; now it switches to the Cabinet view, where the window with the suggestions opens.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooler-layout.novo
wait 30
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
shot panel-3d
click_text "Cooler layout"
wait 3
shot message
wait 30
shot clicked
wait_s 120
expect "Apply the moves"
shot found
check_layout
